WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:01.919
SANDRA OH
I will say, Awkwafina is terrible.

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.378
She breaks all the time!

00:00:03.462 --> 00:00:04.922
SANDRA OH and AWKWAFINA
[Laughing]

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:08.592
AWKWAFINA
This film is about

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:12.304
two sisters reconnecting,
based on who they are now as adults.

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:13.013
TERRY MCTEER
This is fun.

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:15.974
AWKWAFINA
I'm such a huge fan of Sandra.

00:00:16.058 --> 00:00:18.519
To actually play sisters was so cool.

00:00:18.602 --> 00:00:19.686
-Hit the button.
-Annie!

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:20.729
-I can't hear you!
-There's a button there!

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:21.855
ANNE
Hit the god--

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:24.650
-[Doorbell dings]
-[Sighs]

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.152
SANDRA OH
This is one of the best experiences

00:00:27.236 --> 00:00:28.153
of my career.

00:00:28.237 --> 00:00:29.029
JENNY
This is my destiny!

00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:30.322
ANNE
[Laughs]

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:32.032
SANDRA OH
I remember talking to Awkwafina

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:33.825
and saying, "What do you think
about me playing Jenny?"

00:00:33.909 --> 00:00:34.826
And she said...

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:36.537
"You can play
whatever the **** you want."

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:38.330
[Crash]

00:00:38.664 --> 00:00:39.831
JESSICA YU
Sandra and Awkwafina

00:00:39.915 --> 00:00:41.416
know each other better than anyone.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.878
The way that they are tuned
to each other is quite spectacular.

00:00:44.962 --> 00:00:45.796
-[Yelling]
-[Screaming]

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.047
ANNE
Jenny! Look out!

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:48.215
-[Car horn]
-[Screaming]

00:00:48.298 --> 00:00:49.299
[Tires screeching]

00:00:50.926 --> 00:00:52.177
JEN D'ANGELO
They had such great ideas

00:00:52.261 --> 00:00:53.887
to make this even more funny.

00:00:53.971 --> 00:00:55.597
JENNY
I think I might have manifested this.

00:00:55.681 --> 00:00:58.267
SANDRA OH
Awkwafina and I were improvising so much.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.018
AWKWAFINA
She took the improv a little far, I think.

00:01:00.102 --> 00:01:02.271
At one point,
Sandra put her foot in my mouth.

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:04.356
AWKWAFINA
[Laughs]

00:01:05.357 --> 00:01:06.441
SANDRA OH
I hope that people

00:01:06.525 --> 00:01:09.486
get a sliver of how fun
it was to shoot it.

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.405
TV AUDIENCE
[Cheering]

00:01:11.488 --> 00:01:13.115
-[Ketchup bottles crashing]
-[Laughter]

